= Instructions

To make the honey syrup:\
Combine equal parts @Honey{2 tablespoons} and @Water{2 tablespoons} in a #Microwave-safe bowl or small saucepan{}.
Warm in the microwave or over the stovetop just until you can completely stir the honey into the water. Set aside.

Before juicing your lemons, use a vegetable peeler or channel knife to peel off a strip(s) of zest for your twist.

To make the cocktail:\
Fill a #Cocktail shaker{} with ice. Pour in the @Honey syrup{1/2 oz}, @Lemon juice{1 oz} and @Gin{2 oz}.
Securely fasten the lid and shake until the mixture is very cold, about ~{30 seconds}.

Strain the drink into a #Coupe or martini glass{}.
Twist the @Lemon peel{} over the cocktail to release some of its oils, then drop it in. Enjoy while cold.